        <div class="bg-bluelight rounded-2xl shadow-xl border-2 border-[#f56b2a]/10 p-7">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#f56b2a]">Full Profile Optimization</h3>
          <p class="text-body">
            Services, categories, photos, Q&amp;A, hours, and more—optimized to maximize ranking and relevance.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bluelight rounded-2xl shadow-xl border-2 border-[#f56b2a]/10 p-7">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#f56b2a]">Map Pack Ranking & Maps SEO</h3>
          <p class="text-body">
            Targeted keywords across your service area to win visibility where customers look first.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bluelight rounded-2xl shadow-xl border-2 border-[#f56b2a]/10 p-7">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#f56b2a]">Review Generation & Management</h3>
          <p class="text-body">
            Proven review requests and response guidance, plus monitoring for negative or fake reviews.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bluelight rounded-2xl shadow-xl border-2 border-[#f56b2a]/10 p-7">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#f56b2a]">Ongoing Posts, Photos & Updates</h3>
          <p class="text-body">Regular posts, photos, and updates keep your profile fresh—Google loves activity.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-bluelight rounded-2xl shadow-xl border-2 border-[#f56b2a]/10 p-7">
          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#f56b2a]">Spam Fighting & Profile Defense</h3>
          <p class="text-body">We monitor competitors and fake edits—protecting your rankings 24/7.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHY US -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-cream border-t border-gray-100" id="why">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading text-heading font-bold mb-8 text-center">
        Why Home Service Pros Trust Lilos Growth
        <span class="block mx-auto mt-2 h-1 w-14 bg-[#f56b2a] rounded"></span>
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-[#f56b2a]/10">
          <span class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-[#f56b2a]/10">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[#f56b2a]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              ><path d="M3 12l6 6l12-12"></path></svg
            >
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-heading font-bold text-heading mb-2 text-center">Built by Home Service Owners</h3>
          <p class="text-body text-center">
            We’ve run local service companies ourselves—our playbooks were built in the field.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-[#f56b2a]/10">
          <span class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-[#f56b2a]/10">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[#f56b2a]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              ><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle></svg
            >
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-heading font-bold text-heading mb-2 text-center">Specialists in Home Services</h3>
          <p class="text-body text-center">Niche focus = faster wins and tighter execution.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-[#f56b2a]/10">
          <span class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-[#f56b2a]/10">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[#f56b2a]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              ><path d="M4 7l8 8l8-8"></path></svg
            >
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-heading font-bold text-heading mb-2 text-center">No Long-Term Contract</h3>
          <p class="text-body text-center">Month-to-month. We earn it with results.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-[#f56b2a]/10">
          <span class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-[#f56b2a]/10">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[#f56b2a]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              ><path d="M5 12l5 5L20 7"></path></svg
            >
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-heading font-bold text-heading mb-2 text-center">Results You Can See</h3>
          <p class="text-body text-center">Map rankings, calls, and booked jobs—not vanity metrics.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-[#f56b2a]/10">
          <span class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-[#f56b2a]/10">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[#f56b2a]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              ><path d="M12 8v4l3 3"></path></svg
            >
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-heading font-bold text-heading mb-2 text-center">No Big Agency Fluff</h3>
          <p class="text-body text-center">Direct access to your strategist. Clear plans. Clear reports.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg border border-[#f56b2a]/10">
          <span class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-[#f56b2a]/10">
            <svg class="w-7 h-7 text-[#f56b2a]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              ><circle cx="9" cy="10" r="1"></circle><circle cx="15" cy="10" r="1"></circle><path
                d="M8 15s1.5-2 4-2 4 2 4 2"></path></svg
            >
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-heading font-bold text-heading mb-2 text-center">Easy, Honest, & Human</h3>
          <p class="text-body text-center">No jargon. No surprises. Just work that moves the needle.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- MAIN GBP SERVICE: SINGLE LARGE CARD (matches Web Design main card) -->
  <section class="py-24 bg-cream border-t border-gray-100 shadow-xl" id="gbp-main">
