                </div>
                <ul class="text-body text-base space-y-1 text-left list-disc pl-5">
                  <li><span class="font-semibold">10–15</span> new service/location pages / mo</li>
                  <li><span class="font-semibold">10</span> blog posts / mo</li>
                  <li>Citation build &amp; cleanup (software + manual core listings)</li>
